{"slug":"Leetcode-14-Longest-Common-Prefix","title":"Leetcode#14. Longest Common Prefix","date":"2023-07-13","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","easy"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"# Write a function to find the longest common prefix string amongst an array of strings. If there is no common prefix, return an empty string . Example 1: Example 2:","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<p>#<span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span>\nWrite a function to find the longest common prefix string amongst an array of strings.</p>\n<p>If there is no common prefix, return an empty string <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>\"\"</span></span></code></span>.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: strs = [\"flower\",\"flow\",\"flight\"]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: \"fl\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: strs = [\"dog\",\"racecar\",\"car\"]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: \"\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Explanation: There is no common prefix among the input strings.</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> longestCommonPrefix</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">strs</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">str</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">str</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        pref </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> ''</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        minWord </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(strs, </span><span style=\"color:#E06C75;font-style:italic\">key</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(minWord):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> word </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> strs:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> word[i] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> minWord[i]:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                    return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> pref</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            pref </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> minWord[i]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            i </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> pref</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}